                                "sense_id": "5783f657-d282-30f8-bd31-53b91c332a64",
                                "text": "While dissemination of the Bible, without commentary, leads to the overthrow of all beliefs, the mysticism which one is supposed to reach through this Biblism leads to the conviction that the perfect security of the soul in the love of God renders unimportant the actions of the body, even those which were commonly held to be the most guilty."
                            }
                        ]
